hashicorp-security.asc belongs here: HashiCorp's armored release signing
public key, primary fingerprint C874011F0AB405110D02105534365D9472D7468F
(upstream.HashiCorpFingerprint). The provider binary embeds it and
tools/pinupstream reads it. Until it is committed, runtime download fails
closed. tools/pinupstream/main.go describes how to fetch and check it.
